  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Secondment to UNMIK</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Sekondering UNMIK</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Tv&#xE5; svenska experter inom gruv- och metallsektorn samt inom  energisektorn sekonderas till UNMIK Department of Environment under en 12-m&#xE5;nadersperiod, med m&#xF6;jlighet till f&#xF6;rl&#xE4;ngning. De skall st&#xE4;rka DEPs i deras roll vid beslut och planering av investeringar som har en stor potentiell milj&#xF6;p&#xE5;verkan. De skall arbeta med kunskaps&#xF6;verf&#xF6;r</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Two Swedish experts in the energy sector and in the metallurgical and mining sector will be seconded to Department of Environment for a 12 month period, with a possible prolongation. They should strengthen DEPs capacity to get involved in the decision-making process when new investments are discussed or planned for and build capacity.</narrative>
  </description>
